doc:sec-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4 Schedule 15," ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "item 52 The day after this Act receives the Royal Assent. However, the provision does not commence at all if item 7 of Schedule 2 to the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Amendment (Data Retention) Act 2015 commences on or before the day after this Act receives the Royal Assent. Never commenced" ;
