concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-309-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "309 13);"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-309-2 ;
    values:originalText "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Serious drug offences  Schedule 1  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015  (e) that a substance is a border controlled precursor (a physical element of an offence against Subdivision D of Division 307 or section 309.14 or 309.15). Note: Proof of intention, knowledge or recklessness will satisfy a fault element of recklessness: see subsection 5.4(4)." ;
    skos:definition "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Serious drug offences  Schedule 1  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015  (e) that a substance is a border controlled precursor (a physical element of an offence against Subdivision D of Division 307 or section 309.14 or 309.15). Note: Proof of intention, knowledge or recklessness will satisfy a fault element of recklessness: see subsection 5.4(4)."@en ;
