    cof:title "8 Application of amendments" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by items 2 to 7 apply in relation to offences constituted by conduct engaged in on or after the commencement of this Schedule. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 2  Bribing foreign public officials  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015 No. 153, 2015" ;
    cof:pageNumber "11"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-2-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Subsection 70.2(1A) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1A) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(c):  (a) the first-mentioned person does not need to intend to influence a particular foreign public official; and  (b) business, or a business advantage, does not need to be actually obtained or retained. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Outrages upon personal dignity  Schedule 3  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1A) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(c):  (a) the first-mentioned person does not need to intend to influence a particular foreign public official; and  (b) business, or a business advantage, does not need to be actually obtained or retained. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Outrages upon personal dignity  Schedule 3  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7b3da98d45d2333e7bdd191f0ae0c9eb2c51a0966367cf4cc43f6ce277758c26" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Repeal subsection 70.2(1A) of the Criminal Code and substitute with new provisions." ;
