concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Subsections 268.74(2) and (3) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsections, substitute:  (2) To avoid doubt, a reference in subsection (1) to a person or persons who are not taking an active part in the hostilities includes a reference to a person or persons who:  (a) are hors de combat; or  (b) are civilians, medical personnel or religious personnel who are not taking an active part in the hostilities; or  (c) are dead. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 4  Forced marriage  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015 No. 153, 2015" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsections, substitute:  (2) To avoid doubt, a reference in subsection (1) to a person or persons who are not taking an active part in the hostilities includes a reference to a person or persons who:  (a) are hors de combat; or  (b) are civilians, medical personnel or religious personnel who are not taking an active part in the hostilities; or  (c) are dead. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 4  Forced marriage  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015 No. 153, 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a6e2c5f69686a23817471ea00fbd882320055e950ab5fe4fd3ebf342333ccfed" ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Specify who is not taking an active part in hostilities for the purpose of subsection (1)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
