concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to determining, on or after the commencement of this item, a sentence to be passed, or an order to be made, in respect of a person, whether the person is convicted before, at or after that commencement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Sentencing and parole  Schedule 7 Cooperation with law enforcement agencies  Part 2  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    skos:definition "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to determining, on or after the commencement of this item, a sentence to be passed, or an order to be made, in respect of a person, whether the person is convicted before, at or after that commencement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Sentencing and parole  Schedule 7 Cooperation with law enforcement agencies  Part 2  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8f716c943b02e04246f0c3e3b545fab16990bd4037e4d1cfe61341a20a3b4e4c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendment applies to determining sentences or orders after commencement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
