    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to a federal sentence imposed on or after the commencement of this item. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Sentencing and parole  Schedule 7 Non-parole periods and recognizance release orders  Part 4  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
