concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Subsections 19AC(4) and (5)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsections, substitute:  (4) A court may decline to make a recognizance release order in respect of a person if:  (a) the court is satisfied that such an order is not appropriate, having regard to:  (i) the nature and circumstances of the offence or offences concerned; and  (ii) the antecedents of the person; or  (b) the person is expected to be serving a State or Territory sentence on the day after the end of the federal sentence, or the last to be served of the federal sentences, as reduced by any remissions or reductions under section 19AA.  (5) If the court declines to make a recognizance release order, the court must:  (a) state its reasons for so declining; and  (b) cause the reasons to be entered in the records of the court. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Sentencing and parole  Schedule 7 Non-parole periods and recognizance release orders  Part 4  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsections, substitute:  (4) A court may decline to make a recognizance release order in respect of a person if:  (a) the court is satisfied that such an order is not appropriate, having regard to:  (i) the nature and circumstances of the offence or offences concerned; and  (ii) the antecedents of the person; or  (b) the person is expected to be serving a State or Territory sentence on the day after the end of the federal sentence, or the last to be served of the federal sentences, as reduced by any remissions or reductions under section 19AA.  (5) If the court declines to make a recognizance release order, the court must:  (a) state its reasons for so declining; and  (b) cause the reasons to be entered in the records of the court. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Sentencing and parole  Schedule 7 Non-parole periods and recognizance release orders  Part 4  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "45006b563b2fa2182b7ea81cca2aac16faa404d7946d1c0f51f91fbff6cf069d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-12-ss-4 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-12-ss-5 ;
