concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-7-sec-43 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "43 After subsection 20(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-43 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (1A) If the court specifies under paragraph (1)(a) or (b), as mentioned in subparagraph (1)(a)(iv), the condition that the person will, during the specified period:  (a) be subject to the supervision of a probation officer appointed in accordance with the order; and  (b) obey all reasonable directions of the probation officer; the court must also specify the condition that the person will not travel interstate or overseas without the written permission of the probation officer. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Sentencing and parole  Schedule 7 Alternative sentencing options  Part 11  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (1A) If the court specifies under paragraph (1)(a) or (b), as mentioned in subparagraph (1)(a)(iv), the condition that the person will, during the specified period:  (a) be subject to the supervision of a probation officer appointed in accordance with the order; and  (b) obey all reasonable directions of the probation officer; the court must also specify the condition that the person will not travel interstate or overseas without the written permission of the probation officer. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Sentencing and parole  Schedule 7 Alternative sentencing options  Part 11  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "39bfa5653dcfc25b9d663aa54574a3540f899b21540a44fe08c7b7c2a4401df6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Restrict travel without permission" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf> ;
