concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-9-sec-20bz-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20BZ(6) Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-20bz-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Despite subsection (4), the Registrar or another officer of a court is not required to comply with a notice given under subsection (3) to the extent that the information relates to proceedings that have not been finally determined by the court. 20BZB  Authorised officers may disclose federal offender information" ;
    skos:definition "(6) Despite subsection (4), the Registrar or another officer of a court is not required to comply with a notice given under subsection (3) to the extent that the information relates to proceedings that have not been finally determined by the court. 20BZB  Authorised officers may disclose federal offender information"@en ;
