concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-11-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Paragraphs 10(5)(a) and (aa)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (a) a person is a secondee to the AFP if the person is referred to in paragraph (g) of the definition of AFP appointee in section 4 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979; and  (aa) a person is a secondee to the AFP if the person: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 11  Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015 No. 153, 2015  (i) is referred to in paragraph (c) or (d) of the definition of AFP appointee in section 4 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979; and  (ii) is also an employee of another government agency; and" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (a) a person is a secondee to the AFP if the person is referred to in paragraph (g) of the definition of AFP appointee in section 4 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979; and  (aa) a person is a secondee to the AFP if the person: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 11  Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015 No. 153, 2015  (i) is referred to in paragraph (c) or (d) of the definition of AFP appointee in section 4 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979; and  (ii) is also an employee of another government agency; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b97ff26eebb66a665ff07873296a0c433e4657c2dab941bf638eff249a6c2f63" ;
    cof:pageNumber "45"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Repeal and substitute paragraphs regarding AFP appointees." ;
