concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-11-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 After subsection 31(3)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: Requesting information to assist in making the decision  (3A) For the purposes of making a decision under subsection (2), the Integrity Commissioner may request the head of a law enforcement agency to give the Integrity Commissioner the information specified in the request.  (3B) The head of the law enforcement agency must comply with the request. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity  Schedule 11  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015  (3C) Subsection (3A) does not limit the information to which the Integrity Commissioner may have regard in making a decision under subsection (2). Deciding to take no further action" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: Requesting information to assist in making the decision  (3A) For the purposes of making a decision under subsection (2), the Integrity Commissioner may request the head of a law enforcement agency to give the Integrity Commissioner the information specified in the request.  (3B) The head of the law enforcement agency must comply with the request. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Australian Commission for Law Enforcement Integrity  Schedule 11  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015  (3C) Subsection (3A) does not limit the information to which the Integrity Commissioner may have regard in making a decision under subsection (2). Deciding to take no further action"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "139a0e4f13a17537eff01f11cc339be1c738b4d647818c0382637a44ab9f7cc9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "46"^^xsd:integer ;
