concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-14-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Paragraph 330(4)(e) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, applies whether the forfeiture, confiscation or other disposal occurred before, on or after the commencement of this Part. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 14  Proceeds of crime—other matters" ;
    skos:definition "Paragraph 330(4)(e) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, applies whether the forfeiture, confiscation or other disposal occurred before, on or after the commencement of this Part. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 14  Proceeds of crime—other matters"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1b0696b9219539e7984015c53b69474a55c30addc0b1a9b7c37d7bab801a5741" ;
    cof:pageNumber "57"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Paragraph 330(4)(e) applies regardless of when the forfeiture/disposal occurred." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
