concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-42 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42 Related offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-14-sec-42 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Act, 2 offences are related to each other if the physical elements of the 2 offences are:  (a) substantially the same acts or omissions; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Proceeds of crime—other matters  Schedule 14 Related offences  Part 2  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015  (b) acts or omissions in a single series." ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of this Act, 2 offences are related to each other if the physical elements of the 2 offences are:  (a) substantially the same acts or omissions; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Proceeds of crime—other matters  Schedule 14 Related offences  Part 2  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015  (b) acts or omissions in a single series."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4ae651f7a94a54a0b680b7fe8ef57b291a0bfef2f54a22a7e86a8d643c9d11dc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Offences are related if their physical elements are substantially the same or in a single series." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
