concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Subsection 3(1) (definition of related foreign serious"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-14-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "offence) Repeal the definition, substitute: related foreign serious offence: a foreign serious offence is a related foreign serious offence in relation to another foreign serious offence if the physical elements of the 2 offences are:  (a) substantially the same acts or omissions; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 14  Proceeds of crime—other matters" ;
    skos:definition "offence) Repeal the definition, substitute: related foreign serious offence: a foreign serious offence is a related foreign serious offence in relation to another foreign serious offence if the physical elements of the 2 offences are:  (a) substantially the same acts or omissions; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  Schedule 14  Proceeds of crime—other matters"@en ;
