concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-14-sec-315c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "315C Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-14-sec-315c ;
    values:originalText "Commonwealth  The *Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the Commonwealth if, in the Official Trustee’s opinion, doing so will facilitate the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of a power, of the Official Trustee under this Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  State law enforcement agencies  Schedule 15 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    skos:definition "Commonwealth  The *Official Trustee may bring proceedings on behalf of the Commonwealth if, in the Official Trustee’s opinion, doing so will facilitate the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of a power, of the Official Trustee under this Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00153  State law enforcement agencies  Schedule 15 Main amendments  Part 1  No. 153, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2015"@en ;
