concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-15-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Section 85ZL (paragraphs (f) and (g) of the definition of law"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-15-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "enforcement agency) Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (f) the Independent Commission Against Corruption of New South Wales, or a similar body established under a law of another State; or  (fa) the Independent Commissioner Against Corruption of South Australia, or a similar officer appointed under a law of another State, other than an officer belonging to a body to which paragraph (f) applies; or  (g) the New South Wales Crime Commission, or a similar body established under a law of another State; or" ;
    skos:definition "enforcement agency) Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (f) the Independent Commission Against Corruption of New South Wales, or a similar body established under a law of another State; or  (fa) the Independent Commissioner Against Corruption of South Australia, or a similar officer appointed under a law of another State, other than an officer belonging to a body to which paragraph (f) applies; or  (g) the New South Wales Crime Commission, or a similar body established under a law of another State; or"@en ;
