concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-15-sec-43 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "43 Subsection 5(1) (paragraph (ga) of the definition of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-15-sec-43 ;
    values:originalText "permitted purpose) Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (ga) in the case of the Crime and Corruption Commission:  (i) an investigation under the Crime and Corruption Act into whether corruption (within the meaning of that Act) may have occurred, may be occurring or may be about to occur; or  (ii) a report on such an investigation; or" ;
    skos:definition "permitted purpose) Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (ga) in the case of the Crime and Corruption Commission:  (i) an investigation under the Crime and Corruption Act into whether corruption (within the meaning of that Act) may have occurred, may be occurring or may be about to occur; or  (ii) a report on such an investigation; or"@en ;
